        "responses": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=### ROLE\nYou are an expert AI Support Assistant. Your goal is to draft a professional, grounded email response using ONLY the provided Knowledge Base Context.\n\n### INPUT DATA\n- Customer name: {{ $json.name }}\n- Customer ticket: {{ $json.subject }} - {{ $json.message }}\n- Customer sentiment: {{ $json.sentiment }}\n- Knowledge Base Context (top matches):\n{{ $json.context }}\n\n### EXECUTION RULES\n1. STRICT GROUNDING: Use ONLY the Knowledge Base Context. If it does not contain the answer, say that a support agent will follow up; do not guess.\n2. TONE MATCHING: If sentiment is 'negative', be empathetic and apologetic. If 'neutral' or 'positive', be concise and professional.\n3. NO HALLUCINATION: Do not invent names, dates, amounts or procedures that are not in the context.\n4. STRUCTURE: greeting, direct answer, clear next steps, sign-off.\n\n### OUTPUT\nOutput only the final email draft. No preamble. Sign as: NOAVIA Support Team. Never use placeholders such as [Your Name]."
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.openAi",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        1400,
        0
      ],
      "id": "016d83cc-02fd-42f2-bb36-4ad7795715dc",
      "name": "Draft grounded reply",
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 2,
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const t = $('Combine retrieved chunks').item.json;\nconst draft = $json.output?.[0]?.content?.[0]?.text ?? '';\nreturn { json: {\n  ...t,\n  draft_response: draft,\n  status: draft ? t.status : 'needs_manual_review',\n  processing_log: `${t.processing_log} -> ${draft ? 'draft generated' : 'draft failed'}`,\n} };",
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem"
